comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T22:11:59.104Z","harness:opencode","Verification evidence: convention appended to pm-doxj body (Convention addition 2026-07-25); post-change graph analyze shows 2,046 nodes / 4,536 edges with cycle_count unchanged at the 8 known legacy ordering cycles (owned by pm-hnc9w7) and audit findings unchanged at 11 info-level legacy classes; validate reports zero history drift and only the canonical owned resolution-field warning class; pnpm build passes. Duplicate evidence: keyword searches for pass-numbering conventions and pm dedupe-audit found no pre-existing convention item before creation."
